submission_format:
Return a JSON object with the same keys and nesting as the example below.

```json
{
  "artifacts": {
    "run_log": "/workspace/output/run.jsonl"
  },
  "results": {
    "mean_frequency": 0.0,
    "std_frequency": 0.0
  }
}
```

Units: mean_frequency and std_frequency in THz.

Use the format below for the file `/workspace/output/run.jsonl`:
JSONL with one VDOS record containing equal-length frequency_THz and vdos arrays. Frequencies increase from zero in THz; power is nonnegative with positive integrated area. Use your calculated values.
```text
{"type":"vdos","frequency_THz":[0,1,2,3,4],"vdos":[0,1,2,1,0]}
```
